OL,3,GNEWSACollapse risk sparks urgent
OL,4,Arepairs to church
OL,5,
OL,6,FUrgent repairs will be carried out on
OL,7,Fone of Norwich's "grandest" churches
OL,8,Fwhich is in danger of partially
OL,9,Fcollapsing into a busy street.
OL,11,FSt Gregory's Church dates back to the
OL,12,F14th Century but a report warned parts
OL,13,Fof the building have badly
OL,14,Fdeteriorated.
OL,16,FWhile it is no longer used for worship,
OL,17,Fthe building on Pottergate remains in
OL,18,Fuse seven days a week as an antiques
OL,19,Fcentre.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
